","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 29.2%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 5.84"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":104.5,"default_fair_val":104.5,"premium_pct":19,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":13.2,"pe_forward":11.6,"pb_trailing":1.8,"pb_forward":1.6,"div_yield":0.82,"ps_ratio":4.6,"fcf_to_ev":5.3,"fcf_to_mcap":5.48,"liab_to_assets":29.2,"cash_to_assets":7.4,"current_ratio":5.84,"roe":13.7,"roa":9.7,"moat":{"ticker":"PHM","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"PulteGroup 在住宅建築行業中，其品牌定價能力相對有限。雖然 Pulte Homes 和 Centex 等品牌在市場上有一定的知名度，但與汽車或消費品領域的強勢品牌相比，其品牌溢價空間不大。購房者更看重房屋的性價比、地點和功能性，而非單純的品牌忠誠度。因此，在面對市場波動或競爭加劇時，PulteGroup 的品牌難以支撐顯著的價格提升，其定價權主要受制於整體房地產市場的週期性及建築成本。","comment_en":"PulteGroup's brand pricing power in the residential construction industry is relatively limited. While brands like Pulte Homes and Centex have some market recognition, they do not command the significant brand premium seen in sectors like automotive or consumer goods. Homebuyers prioritize value for money, location, and functionality over pure brand loyalty. Consequently, PulteGroup's brand struggles to support substantial price increases when facing market fluctuations or intensified competition. Its pricing power is primarily dictated by the cyclical nature of the overall real estate market and construction costs."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"住宅建築行業的進入壁壘相對較低，專利和監管壁壘在此領域幾乎不存在。PulteGroup 的核心競爭力在於其營運效率和規模，而非技術專利。雖然建築規範和土地使用條例構成一定的進入門檻，但這些並非 PulteGroup 獨有的專利或特許權，而是行業普遍遵循的規則。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，PulteGroup 幾乎沒有形成獨特的護城河。","comment_en":"The residential construction industry has relatively low barriers to entry, and patent or regulatory moats are virtually non-existent in this sector. PulteGroup's core strength lies in its operational efficiency and scale, not in technological patents. While building codes and land use regulations present some entry hurdles, these are not unique patents or licenses exclusive to PulteGroup but rather industry-wide rules. Therefore, PulteGroup possesses almost no unique moat in terms of patents and regulatory barriers."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"對於購房者而言，更換房屋供應商的轉換成本非常高，這主要源於購房決策的重大性、時間成本以及與新開發商重新建立信任的難度。然而，這並非 PulteGroup 獨有的轉換成本壁壘，而是整個住宅建築行業的共性。一旦客戶選擇了 PulteGroup，他們在購房過程中投入了大量時間和精力，不太可能輕易轉向其他建築商。但這並不能構成 PulteGroup 相對於競爭對手的獨特優勢。","comment_en":"For homebuyers, the switching costs of changing home suppliers are extremely high, primarily due to the significance of the purchase decision, the time investment, and the difficulty of re-establishing trust with a new developer. However, this is a common characteristic of the entire residential construction industry rather than a switching cost moat unique to PulteGroup. Once a customer chooses PulteGroup, they invest substantial time and effort in the home-buying process, making it unlikely they would easily switch to another builder. This, however, does not constitute a distinct advantage for PulteGroup over its competitors."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"住宅建築行業幾乎不存在網絡效應。PulteGroup 的業務模式不依賴於用戶數量的增加來提升產品或服務的價值。客戶購買房屋是基於個人需求、地點和價格等因素，而非因為有更多人選擇 PulteGroup。其業務的成功更多取決於市場需求、土地儲備、建築能力和融資條件，而非由網絡效應驅動的客戶群體擴張。","comment_en":"Network effects are virtually non-existent in the residential construction industry. PulteGroup's business model does not rely on an increasing number of users to enhance the value of its products or services. Customers purchase homes based on individual needs, location, and price, not because more people are choosing PulteGroup. The success of its business is more dependent on market demand, land inventory, construction capabilities, and financing conditions, rather than customer base expansion driven by network effects."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"PulteGroup 作為美國領先的住宅建築商之一，其規模經濟帶來了顯著的成本優勢。公司能夠透過大批量採購建築材料、標準化設計和施工流程，以及與供應商建立長期合作關係，獲得比小型競爭對手更低的單位成本。此外，其龐大的土地儲備和高效的營運管理，也進一步鞏固了其成本領先地位，使其在價格競爭中更具優勢。","comment_en":"As one of the leading homebuilders in the United States, PulteGroup benefits from significant cost advantages derived from economies of scale. The company can achieve lower unit costs compared to smaller competitors through bulk purchasing of construction materials, standardized designs and construction processes, and establishing long-term relationships with suppliers. Furthermore, its substantial land inventory and efficient operational management further solidify its cost leadership, providing a competitive edge in pricing."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"PulteGroup 在美國多個高增長地區擁有廣泛的土地儲備，這構成了一定的地理資產優勢。然而，這些土地並非完全不可複製，其他大型建築商同樣可以透過市場競爭獲取土地。其優勢在於能夠在關鍵市場提前佈局並獲得有吸引力的地塊，從而滿足未來幾年的銷售需求。但這並非絕對的壟斷性資產，其價值會隨市場變化而波動。","comment_en":"PulteGroup possesses extensive land inventory across multiple high-growth regions in the United States, which provides a certain geographical asset advantage. However, this land is not entirely irreproducible, as other large builders can also acquire land through market competition. Its advantage lies in its ability to strategically position itself in key markets and secure attractive parcels to meet sales demand for the coming years. Nevertheless, these are not absolute monopolistic assets, and their value can fluctuate with market changes."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"PulteGroup 在營運效率方面表現出色，這得益於其標準化的建築流程、精細化的成本控制以及對供應鏈的有效管理。公司能夠在保證產品質量的同時，最大化生產效率，縮短建築週期，從而降低單位成本並提高利潤率。其持續優化的營運模式，使其在行業週期波動中仍能保持較高的盈利能力和穩定的現金流，這體現了其卓越的執行力。","comment_en":"PulteGroup demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, attributed to its standardized construction processes, meticulous cost control, and effective supply chain management. The company maximizes production efficiency and shortens construction cycles while ensuring product quality, thereby reducing unit costs and improving profit margins. Its continuously optimized operational model allows it to maintain high profitability and stable cash flow even amidst industry cyclical fluctuations, reflecting its superior execution capabilities."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"PulteGroup 在資本配置方面展現出相對穩健的策略。公司透過有效的土地收購和開發，以及適度的股票回購和股息支付，來平衡增長與股東回報。其較高的股東權益報酬率 (ROE) 和資產報酬率 (ROA) 表明其資本配置能夠產生不錯的回報。儘管行業週期性帶來挑戰，但公司在維持健康的資產負債表和產生自由現金流方面表現良好，顯示其在資源分配上具有一定的審慎和效率。","comment_en":"PulteGroup exhibits a relatively sound strategy in capital allocation. The company balances growth and shareholder returns through effective land acquisition and development, along with moderate share repurchases and dividend payments. Its high Return on Equity (ROE) and Return on Assets (ROA) indicate that its capital allocation generates decent returns. Despite the challenges posed by industry cyclicality, the company performs well in maintaining a healthy balance sheet and generating free cash flow, demonstrating a degree of prudence and efficiency in resource allocation."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"住宅建築行業的客戶留存率概念與傳統的重複消費品或服務行業不同。PulteGroup 的客戶在完成購房後，通常不會進行重複購買，除非是換房需求。因此，其客戶留存更多體現在品牌聲譽和售後服務的口碑上，這有助於吸引新客戶。雖然 PulteGroup 注重客戶滿意度，但其業務模式本身不具備高客戶留存率所帶來的網絡效應或持續收入流的護城河。","comment_en":"The concept of customer retention in the residential construction industry differs from traditional repeat-purchase consumer goods or services. PulteGroup's customers typically do not make repeat purchases after completing a home acquisition, unless they are upgrading or downsizing. Therefore, customer retention is more reflected in brand reputation and word-of-mouth from after-sales service, which helps attract new customers. While PulteGroup focuses on customer satisfaction, its business model inherently lacks the moats of network effects or recurring revenue streams that high customer retention rates typically provide."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"PulteGroup 的業務具有一定的週期性，其表現與整體宏觀經濟和利率環境密切相關。雖然房屋本身具有長期價值，但建築商的盈利能力會受到市場需求、建築成本和融資條件的顯著影響。PulteGroup 的規模和營運效率使其在行業低谷時更具韌性，但其業務的長期穩定性仍受外部經濟週期的制約，難以達到公用事業或必需消費品那樣的穩定性。","comment_en":"PulteGroup's business is inherently cyclical, with performance closely tied to the overall macroeconomic and interest rate environment. While homes themselves hold long-term value, the profitability of builders is significantly influenced by market demand, construction costs, and financing conditions. PulteGroup's scale and operational efficiency provide resilience during industry downturns, but the long-term stability of its business remains constrained by external economic cycles, making it difficult to achieve the same level of stability as utilities or essential consumer goods."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"PulteGroup 作為美國大型住宅建築商，其主要護城河體現在規模經濟帶來的成本優勢（M5）和卓越的營運效率（M7）。這使其在土地獲取和標準化生產方面具備競爭力。然而，其品牌定價權（M1）、網絡效應（M4）和專利壁壘（M2）相對薄弱。雖然轉換成本（M3）和地理資產（M6）存在，但並非 PulteGroup 獨有。業務的週期性（M10）限制了其長期穩定性。整體而言，PulteGroup 屬於一個受經濟週期影響較大的週期性行業中的營運效率型公司，而非擁有強大特許經營權或網絡效應的企業。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"As a major U.S. homebuilder, PulteGroup's primary moats lie in its cost advantages derived from economies of scale (M5) and its excellent operational efficiency (M7), which make it competitive in land acquisition and standardized production. However, its brand pricing power (M1), network effects (M4), and patent barriers (M2) are relatively weak. While switching costs (M3) and geographical assets (M6) exist, they are not unique to PulteGroup. The cyclical nature of its business (M10) limits its long-term stability. Overall, PulteGroup operates as an operationally efficient company within a cyclical industry heavily influenced by economic cycles, rather than possessing strong franchise power or network effects.","evidenceHash":"f9177821b776d627f54be3b769ef06bb9df0881e86f3796a96b4b0c3b77d42bc","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-30T17:41:00.613Z","evidenceHash":"c19e0c9ce7ce29afd680fa6b5184485745ce84accd37bc0d1a081c2a8a58b26c"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2024-12-31","period":"FY 2024","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"windowDressing","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-30T17:41:00.613Z","evidenceHash":"c19e0c9ce7ce29afd680fa6b5184485745ce84accd37bc0d1a081c2a8a58b26c"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PHM.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PHM.png","website":"https://www.pultegroupinc.com","ceo":"Ryan R. Marshall","full_time_employees":"6506","description":"PulteGroup, Inc. engages in the homebuilding business. The firm is also involved in mortgage banking and title and insurance brokerage operations. It operates through the Homebuilding and Financial services business segments. The Homebuilding segment includes operations from Connecticut, Maryland, Massachusetts, New Jersey, New York, Pennsylvania, Virginia, Georgia, North Carolina, South Carolina, Tennessee, Florida, Illinois, Indiana, Kentucky, Michigan, Minnesota, Missouri, Ohio, Texas, Arizona, California, Nevada, New Mexico, and Washington. The Financial Services segment is composed of mortgage banking and title operations. The company was founded by William J. Pulte in 1950 and is headquartered in Atlanta, GA.","description_en":"PulteGroup, Inc. engages in the homebuilding business. The firm is also involved in mortgage banking and title and insurance brokerage operations. It op